<section image-layout="blank" id="bFZKQOWbiR"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="sm1YV6FrDW" vertical-align="center" colspan="34"><p role="eyebrow">B.Tech Node.js Laboratory · Illustrative teaching prototype</p><h1 font-size="46pt">One request in.<br>One opaque <code>sid</code> out.</h1><h3 role="subheading">Trace a secure student login without exposing identity or storing plaintext passwords.</h3><spacer size="14pt"></spacer><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="4rDg2d8APq" background-color="surface" cell-decor="top-line" padding="14pt 16pt"><p role="eyebrow">ACTIVE REQUEST TRACE</p><h4>Form → validation → rate limit → lookup → bcrypt → session regeneration → redirect</h4></grid-item></grid><p font-size="sm"><b>Success condition:</b> the browser receives only an opaque cookie. Every restricted route still performs authorization.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="DLBebZ6hXE" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.22" padding="26pt" colspan="26"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/KP4NfltcPpdph-SfvUf9W.png" saved-media-id="ondvowhgcazchf1" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="secure-stack-isometric" alt="Matte isometric secure student portal with one cyan request packet crossing a violet trust boundary toward a server and session vault" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><labels><label variant="outline">ONE REQUEST</label></labels><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="UyliVYz7I5" background-color="surface" padding="14pt 16pt"><labels><label variant="solid">ACTIVE REQUEST</label></labels><h3>POST /login</h3><p font-size="sm">email · password · _csrf</p><hr color="accent" thickness="md"><p font-size="sm"><b>Expected response:</b> 303 + opaque <code>sid</code></p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="7L1wV4aXXH"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="hm_2MKaUJG"><labels><label variant="solid">REQUEST · POST /login</label><label variant="outline">ILLUSTRATIVE UI</label></labels><h2>Browser to POST /login</h2><p>Asha enters <b>asha@campus.example</b> and a masked password. A server-issued CSRF value travels with the form; the password is never echoed or logged.</p><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="A9hxU7fU8c" cell-style="subtle" padding="0" colspan="38"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none"><grid-item id="r56mx0Grin" background-color="surface" padding="9pt 14pt" rowspan="8"><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="Kz59O808oF"><p font-size="sm">● ● ●</p></grid-item><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><grid-item id="ZkTkoVENGo"><p font-size="sm">portal.campus.example/login</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="P-OYcxIZtg" padding="16pt 22pt" rowspan="52"><p role="eyebrow">STUDENT AUTHENTICATION PORTAL</p><h3>Sign in</h3><p font-size="sm">Email</p><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="6q9r6ILhS1" background-color="surface" padding="9pt 12pt"><p>asha@campus.example</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="sm">Password</p><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="uX7oplrfW2" background-color="surface" padding="9pt 12pt"><p>••••••••••••</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="sm"><b>Hidden form value:</b> <code>_csrf=server-issued token</code></p><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="PWMkZmDKmz" background-color="accent" padding="10pt 12pt"><p align="center"><b>Sign in securely</b></p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="W8KDIw_gtw" colspan="22"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="small" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="U9TU9cLMHE" cell-style="subtle"><p role="eyebrow">DEVTOOLS · REQUEST</p><h4>POST /login</h4><p font-size="sm">email · password · _csrf</p></grid-item><grid-item id="YvsFIFF3zK" background-color="palette-3"><p role="eyebrow">SUCCESS</p><h4>303 See Other</h4><p font-size="sm">Location: /dashboard<br>Set-Cookie: sid=opaque</p></grid-item><grid-item id="FC7HyZmE_3" cell-style="subtle"><p role="eyebrow">GENERIC FAILURE</p><h4>401 Unauthorized</h4><p font-size="sm">“Email or password is incorrect.”</p></grid-item><grid-item id="6t0h_cOewo" background-color="surface"><p font-size="sm"><b>Invariant:</b> no password appears in the response, logs, cookie, or browser storage.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="MovnG_AAcg"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="FAKxFzJOOm"><labels><label variant="solid">REQUEST · POST /login</label><label variant="outline">ILLUSTRATIVE TRACE</label></labels><h2>One request, seven observable hops</h2><p>The cyan trace follows one request. Violet outlines are trust boundaries; mint is the verified response.</p><freeform-block w="840" h="270"><box type="image" w="840" h="270" src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/t1IP1h54qlFglGnNMS5uP.png"></box><box type="content" w="840" h="270" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(5,10,19,0.78)"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="208" y="6" w="420" h="140" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(155,123,255,0.10)" style="border: 1pt solid rgb(155, 123, 255); border-radius: 10pt;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="220" y="10" w="190"><p role="eyebrow">APPLICATION BOUNDARY</p></box><box type="content" x="628" y="6" w="212" h="140" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(155,123,255,0.10)" style="border: 1pt solid rgb(155, 123, 255); border-radius: 10pt;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="640" y="10" w="170"><p role="eyebrow">DATA BOUNDARY</p></box><box type="content" x="293" y="157" w="254" h="110" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(155,123,255,0.10)" style="border: 1pt solid rgb(155, 123, 255); border-radius: 10pt;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="305" y="160" w="190"><p role="eyebrow">SESSION BOUNDARY</p></box><shape preset="rightArrow" x="198" y="83" w="18" h="18" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="rightArrow" x="408" y="83" w="18" h="18" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="rightArrow" x="618" y="83" w="18" h="18" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="downArrow" x="726" y="141" w="18" h="24" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="leftArrow" x="576" y="211" w="18" h="18" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="leftArrow" x="281" y="211" w="18" h="18" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><box type="content" x="10" y="42" w="188" h="96" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">01 · BROWSER</p><h4>HTTPS form</h4><p font-size="sm">email · password · _csrf</p></box><box type="content" x="220" y="42" w="188" h="96" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">02 · ROUTE</p><h4>Validate</h4><p font-size="sm">Check shape; normalize email.</p></box><box type="content" x="430" y="42" w="188" h="96" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">03 · MIDDLEWARE</p><h4>Rate limit + CSRF</h4><p font-size="sm">Reject abusive or forged requests.</p></box><box type="content" x="640" y="42" w="188" h="96" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">04 · STUDENT STORE</p><h4>Lookup</h4><p font-size="sm">Parameterized query by email.</p></box><box type="content" x="600" y="178" w="230" h="84" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">05 · DECISION</p><h4>bcrypt.compare()</h4><p font-size="sm">Password vs. stored hash.</p></box><box type="content" x="305" y="178" w="230" h="84" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">06 · SESSION STORE</p><h4>Regenerate + save</h4><p font-size="sm">Store student id and role server-side.</p></box><box type="content" x="10" y="178" w="230" h="84" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-3" style="padding: 10pt 12pt; border-radius: 8pt;"><p role="eyebrow">07 · RESPONSE</p><h4>303 + opaque sid</h4><p font-size="sm">Redirect to /dashboard.</p></box></freeform-block><p font-size="sm"><b>Browser invariant:</b> it never receives <code>password_hash</code>, a role-bearing token, or server-side session state.</p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="EDfcGLJ_ea"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="_hI2hHl6de"><labels><label variant="solid">REQUEST · POST /login</label><label variant="outline">ILLUSTRATIVE CODE</label></labels><h2>The authentication decision—complete and visible</h2><p><b>Concise laboratory excerpt, not a production-complete route.</b> It assumes the project’s chosen async error wrapper and session-store configuration.</p><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="AfeOO1gPlf" cell-style="subtle" padding="0" colspan="34"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none"><grid-item id="DjNM28E6FF" background-color="surface" padding="9pt 14pt"><labels><label variant="outline">1 · VALIDATE + COMPARE</label></labels></grid-item><grid-item id="UXqJzLg9ot" padding="12pt 14pt"><pre language="javascript"><code>// schema validates and normalizes email
const parsed = loginSchema.safeParse(req.body);
if (!parsed.success)
  return res.status(400).render('login');

const { email, password } = parsed.data;
const user = await students.findByEmail(email);
const hash = user?.password_hash
  ?? DUMMY_BCRYPT_HASH;
const ok = await bcrypt.compare(password, hash);

if (!user || !ok || user.status !== 'active')
  return res.status(401).render('login', {
    error: 'Email or password is incorrect.'
  });</code></pre></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="ndUguDlxdX" cell-style="subtle" padding="0" colspan="26"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none"><grid-item id="9cNOo3M4sn" background-color="surface" padding="9pt 14pt"><labels><label variant="outline">2 · REGENERATE + SAVE</label></labels></grid-item><grid-item id="zqdtKbbQ1r" padding="12pt 14pt"><pre language="javascript"><code>req.session.regenerate(err =&gt; {
  if (err) return next(err);

  req.session.user = {
    id: user.id,
    role: user.role
  };

  req.session.save(err =&gt; {
    if (err) return next(err);
    return res.redirect(
      303, '/dashboard'
    );
  });
});</code></pre><aside variant="success"><p><b>Boundary crossed:</b> the old identifier is replaced before authenticated state is stored.</p></aside></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid><p font-size="sm">The dummy bcrypt hash keeps the comparison path similar when no account exists. Source: <a href="https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Authentication_Cheat_Sheet.html">OWASP Authentication Cheat Sheet</a>.</p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="zam3r880Dh"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="-91_ZUjqdD"><labels><label variant="solid">REQUEST · POST /login → sid</label><label variant="outline">SERVER-SIDE SESSION</label></labels><h2>A session is born—without exposing identity</h2><p>The identifier changes at the authentication boundary. The browser keeps only an opaque cookie; identity and role remain in the PostgreSQL-backed session store.</p><grid marker="number" marker-rule="true" marker-position="above" marker-align="start" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-gap: 0.6em;"><grid-item id="LehQIoe7GH" colspan="12"><h4>Anonymous state</h4><p font-size="sm">The login page may already have an anonymous session for its CSRF token.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="r7ViTG6GSe" colspan="12"><h4>Regenerate</h4><p font-size="sm">On success, <code>regenerate()</code> replaces the previous identifier to reduce session-fixation risk.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="woWxKL49sG" colspan="12"><h4>Store identity</h4><p font-size="sm"><code>sid</code> maps to student id and role. No password is stored.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="az7Bsndewv" colspan="12"><h4>Set cookie</h4><p font-size="sm"><code>sid=opaque</code><br>HttpOnly · Secure · SameSite=Lax</p></grid-item><grid-item id="2T8c8vV9fC" colspan="12"><h4>Resolve again</h4><p font-size="sm"><code>GET /dashboard</code> sends <code>sid</code>; <code>requireAuth</code> resolves server-side state.</p></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="rj43tKJSfn" cell-style="subtle" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">BROWSER STATE</p><h4>Opaque sid only</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="-0uicip_Iz" background-color="palette-3" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">SERVER STATE</p><h4>student id · role · authenticated session</h4></grid-item></grid><p role="caption">Source: <a href="https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Session_Management_Cheat_Sheet.html">OWASP Session Management Cheat Sheet</a>.</p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="ujNngJlTI9"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="7x8X53Gp5q"><labels><label variant="solid">REQUEST · CONTROL MAP</label></labels><h2>Controls mapped to concrete failures</h2><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="r2YPFZRxpR" colspan="44"><table col-widths="[34,66]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false"><tbody><tr><td><p>Failure</p></td><td><p>Concrete control</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Credential guessing</b></p></td><td><p>Rate-limit login attempts and return one generic failure.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Injection</b></p></td><td><p>Validate input and use parameterized database queries.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Session fixation</b></p></td><td><p>Regenerate the session identifier after authentication.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Cookie exposure</b></p></td><td><p>Use HTTPS plus HttpOnly, Secure, and SameSite=Lax to reduce exposure and cross-site sending.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>CSRF</b></p></td><td><p>Verify a server-issued token on state-changing forms.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Broken access control</b></p></td><td><p><code>requireRole('admin')</code> returns 403 to an authenticated student.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Logout replay</b></p></td><td><p>Destroy server state and clear <code>sid</code>.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p role="caption">Sources: <a href="https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Authentication_Cheat_Sheet.html">OWASP Authentication</a> · <a href="https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Session_Management_Cheat_Sheet.html">OWASP Session Management</a>.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="XTgdBmAEeQ" align="center" vertical-align="center" colspan="16"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/WF8jRRoCdqwSkRZ96si9d.png" saved-media-id="ybanp5mvssauesg" source="image.ai-generated" width="210pt" height="210pt" image-style="secure-stack-isometric" alt="Isometric security shield enclosing a session vault and opaque cookie capsule" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1440,&quot;height&quot;:1440}"><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="stVAQ6EMuf" background-color="surface" cell-decor="top-line" padding="13pt 15pt"><p role="eyebrow">COOKIE-EXPOSURE MITIGATIONS</p><h4>HTTPS · HttpOnly · Secure · SameSite=Lax</h4><p font-size="sm">Defense in depth—not a guarantee against every theft path.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="S7kA6Fw8A7"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="5xbfU-slo-"><labels><label variant="solid">REQUEST · LIVE TRACE</label><label variant="outline">ILLUSTRATIVE TEST RUN</label></labels><h2>Prove it live, then break it safely</h2><p>Observe the response, cookie, redirect, and protected route together. Authentication succeeds once; authorization is checked again at each boundary.</p><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="mJuqP03ZiO" cell-style="subtle" padding="0" colspan="42"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none"><grid-item id="TEJOrKs1f-" background-color="surface" padding="9pt 14pt"><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="8jbPHEOxWk"><p font-size="sm">authentication-lab · observable outcomes</p></grid-item><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><grid-item id="Z7A80L7lW7"><p font-size="sm">HTTPS · local teaching environment</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="yozCd5EHaf" padding="0"><table col-widths="[14,30,56]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false"><tbody><tr><td><p>HTTP</p></td><td><p>Probe</p></td><td><p>Expected evidence</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>401</b></p></td><td><p>Wrong credentials</p></td><td><p>Generic failure; no authenticated session.</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="palette-3"><p><b>303</b></p></td><td><p>Valid credentials</p></td><td><p>New opaque <code>sid</code>; redirect to /dashboard.</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="palette-3"><p><b>200</b></p></td><td><p>Refresh /dashboard</p></td><td><p><code>requireAuth</code> resolves server-side state.</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="palette-2"><p><b>403</b></p></td><td><p>Open /admin as student</p></td><td><p>Role gate denies access after authentication.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>303 → 401</b></p></td><td><p>Logout, then replay old sid</p></td><td><p>State is destroyed; the old identifier is rejected.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="zVq9DrDLn0" colspan="18"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="small" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="Lw8iOysM7x" background-color="palette-3"><p role="eyebrow">AUTHENTICATION</p><h3>Who is this?</h3><p font-size="sm">Valid credentials establish a server-side student session.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="tcwKC-ZvYF" background-color="palette-2"><p role="eyebrow">AUTHORIZATION</p><h3>May this student enter?</h3><p font-size="sm"><code>/admin</code> still returns 403.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="FBJopVqet9" cell-style="subtle"><p role="eyebrow">LOGOUT PROOF</p><h4>Replay fails</h4><p font-size="sm">Clearing the browser cookie is not enough; server state must be destroyed.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="Db8iDAxYGS" background-color="surface" cell-decor="top-line"><h3>Authenticated ≠ authorized.</h3><p font-size="sm">Trust is rechecked at every protected boundary.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>